{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:00fc334c2f677ca87504f83b3bfa2f65d4e44806b0dc7e1a14e4f92d46f2757d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac26541c69ae6de1d5543be844e9b235ea46b121559c2d6052ff5d11ee29fb47",
      "text": "特殊日子的惊喜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55977faa52bb9772b17ee3676a7f72fbbb1952f14c954c591591360f53a19b8c",
      "text": "生日当天。想乐正在阅读父母、哥哥、Legenders\n以及制作人发来的祝福信息。\n收到了雨彦和克里斯发来在事务所等他的信息，\n想乐则是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac26541c69ae6de1d5543be844e9b235ea46b121559c2d6052ff5d11ee29fb47",
      "text": "特殊日子的惊喜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce008fd3f9abe2e1070aa052a0825dcef1221c501d21ffdc7408a4e262b596d0",
      "text": "（爸爸和妈妈发来联络了呢～。\n居然会在生日当天特意发联络过来～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52526d497283543169ab13f82afb8d856f9220bbc4081cbeb285706633904eb9",
      "text": "（“很期待收到礼物哦～”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8345c4954ce5c8bd9b36ea3c0ed483db7401dac651d83d9cf0c6129f6ac61e8",
      "text": "（哥哥的话……今晚也要加班很晚才回来吗～。\n还是一如既往地忙碌呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a87b5a2e80fc298ac8003eea95a2be7eacff3f656f287d6f9bb05506e4bba16a",
      "text": "（……为了赔罪，说是要带我去吃顿豪华大餐，\n打算去哪里吃呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8611caddb232cbbb9c510c7e079df47439a39dccacf62ea18ad870d238c58b5a",
      "text": "（回复一句“谢谢，我很期待哦～”吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6a59e0bd4ba2315ce70577ec06caf4b93bd5140794e6c8e6042d0f48344c309",
      "text": "（话说回来，跟哥哥出去吃大餐啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bef5fce34e87e5bbba84214cea417440a8070ae759f917969989187cec5fa6c",
      "text": "（之前跟他说“雨彦先生生日的时候大家一起聚餐了哦～”\n那时候的事。他是认真的啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33b3bff0202e53f5294b3cdee1dce32eb6b1661d13e5da5d691039c41c4a62d6",
      "text": "（说什么我生日的时候也去吃顿大餐挺不错的，\n我还以为他只是顺着话茬随口一说呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e67e62e4b7fbaaf526b1d651c18d50835235b5dcb37362eb1bbcbcb1abd987d4",
      "text": "（……说起来Legenders的LINK群里，\n大家也发了信息过来呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f088e8938273bb298a001dd16e3d88a4f0626d42095d2dd5f327d41d8e97999a",
      "text": "（“礼物已经准备好了，我们在事务所等你。\n预计几点能到呢？”……吗～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:531b71ebf9714fea0c740484db96a9a728a3d7e2f32960e0ecdb4578758c826a",
      "text": "（在彼此的生日发发信息、\n准备礼物聚在一起……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b45242e91b22e65c5c7a9d66e4011ec01af69a2cca17464a7f4dea527a62ef9c",
      "text": "（不知不觉间都快变成例行公事了呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6acef36068646c7ba8848b948a327bef31daa1449da58376ecf120769a06a4de",
      "text": "（虽然被庆祝很开心，\n但果然还是有点不太习惯呢～……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a9c634c5f1bdf6e5275972c1b86fd5072e40af29b63a2e03acaada1ffcb118f",
      "text": "（嘛，给雨彦先生和克里斯先生庆祝的时候，\n感觉也挺不可思议的就是了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08d8e84a0772c9c9023a6fee4769432e5bbe24f00ea8954b3ead4d67d246ec74",
      "text": "（我会这么想，也是理所当然的吧～。\n虽然绝对不会对他们本人说就是了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fb8230e378fd383831e2696c5e8e16d9208b41046af7a11faf6538068a07e1e",
      "text": "（与人相处，舒适距离难拿捏。……看来要\n长期交往下去了，还是得适度配合一下呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f1d91783088178a7202d3e966b6ba0f51042c9e2eca2e13c249e794de965aaf",
      "text": "既然没停课，应该能按原定计划到达吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ebe6e6d59419cd668cc37738a558b120c1d3ceee994509038d43479336f442d",
      "text": "（“应该会在昨天说的时间到事务所～”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:282491b286f54fd27a1f89b472a7d5df30ed1048cc1697a5bea0f1929eba6da5",
      "text": "（……这样就好了。\n差不多该去大学了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:230496125ad614a45bd2fc1c827c469fb24ae387d3307f9c39b181f5733b2b27",
      "text": "大学内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c1e0f4bf7d07674e2c66165186a412b72e23744f14dd92b9a43ea3087bd24d3",
      "text": "（今天的课上完了。这样的话，\n能赶上计划中的那班电车了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ffa6e53d01a3df63af9e6b2e1eb70b2f3253fbdef3575e3bc138fb64c67d833",
      "text": "啊，是北村君。今天是你的生日吧，\n祝你生日快乐～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d103feea76f956c3dca26600547b92794e64302c92e385d62f18f99f1e6cb29",
      "text": "居然还记得呀～？谢谢你～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a1d4e442e1d6d038c34f32dc7d48d4a3d42df0b165f1158237e199ad1c6e4ad",
      "text": "北村君，辛苦了！\n祝你生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d2f1fd531cec1b4cc74f5b5f39810f6545ee16d9c499f6555659af09743c6c",
      "text": "谢谢～，好开心呀～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caf1b36dcea6962feebdc9d8b7695bc7990d04cc8c3b864b1eddcd8aeb6f80a",
      "text": "（……总觉得今年，被好多人\n搭话了呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c8f981ba3754fcba0c6e2e5c4f752adb82d69fe8060e74ac8784f63f0feced3",
      "text": "（这说明Legenders的\n人气提高了吗～？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:249cf32ec48d9b452505d09faed383a5062682b1e8e6fe60dc62dbe06cea3343",
      "text": "啊，找到了找到了！喂——北村——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47855dcb397e6b2f65dd6ecae30f20001f6c9d99738a6f763d8ea267474d9448",
      "text": "怎么啦？出什么事了吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61cdc884e2283ef7f347173cd3ff9bcb82c9917ec95fcee907b150b1019607d7",
      "text": "刚才在停车场，有北村的熟人过来了哦。\n最好快点过去一趟比较好吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec5b20a218e26e23cd390b482f9d9b93035b6d3fdcd3de00c7383f149fad7ccb",
      "text": "……我的，熟人？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2779204452ccebfa174c8b5fc5391ea2dad8ac3c25f4b332dde71c393d55e1",
      "text": "大学停车位",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0136aa6bd64c6174d6e625afbeb3de97359f68827d29467272a2ff9df72a3b44",
      "text": "哦，来了啊。辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652ef00d49d844542e36ef53f2b31fe50816ec74794eb1d6470378d5d0d76736",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n想乐，等您好久了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279ab6e4b45cb806123c3545493ab449cdab2074d992320e4f1ba0d1a5dc3afe",
      "text": "为什么你们两位会在大学……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ed63df2a47d5afb1c01e44951ae7a78c4a7ce426bee9bf198a07ff3fa8789ce",
      "text": "刚才不是才刚在LINK上发过，\n说在事务所等我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74be76ea39ab3175fea7a599f6446f608082ea83c3465b004566e689d23ad8df",
      "text": "吓了一跳吗？我想着在特别的日子里搞个惊喜\n也是挺不错的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4dfa59a9957cd9f6359cbfe809768f3471c0916c46ea79c372a761432ee2699",
      "text": "刚好想起来古论今天说过\n要开车去事务所来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53a15beca8991853f022dffb2c728ed318c953c083faddd9e51c36976ba0d993",
      "text": "于是我就提议说，\n那干脆去接北村怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47820c840762efc030c1c28914c64e2a4e7ad0c1b294f538a722a98945805c97",
      "text": "（……这个。雨彦先生肯定是顺着克里斯先生的\n提议借题发挥了吧～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2a58b27a9dddaff4ebdfc5c84404c9d90552151b26270fb5933c022ef1e2c13",
      "text": "（真是个狡猾的大叔呢～。\n不过克里斯先生纯粹是一片好意就是了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d1d1df7c03ea7832b54bd12eb11d54e13899e45ac112c16b43d109f6b52384c",
      "text": "嗯。真的吓了一大跳哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e86ae8a174bbf74a1a7c463d5c9ca4601d8ab0ed5e569ad8761770a5bb17abf",
      "text": "再次祝您生日快乐，想乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c2c056260797a94efea705668f956c11bf0f997c93112d0bf204a01de543624",
      "text": "生日快乐啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_d:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd8d077e9ebd198bd4c10bb969a47e0549c70467b847b03187324bf1f45ed28e",
      "text": "谢谢你们两位～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed361fcfc8b685cd2057477ff66c7eac48ac44ead47baf15abd81dec959ad197",
      "text": "（……有人聚集过来了呢～。\n毕竟他们两个人站在那里太显眼了，也没办法嘛～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64e73e6223ac534e0e92a336547d33d8d8328bb47ee7900d62a4d045f7d191c8",
      "text": "差不多该走了吧？制作人\n还在事务所等着的吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ed8394854381f18e3541d408c6f92d5a9becdaee7a29c4f76214ac3b59eb3de",
      "text": "是啊。我来联系他。\n古论，开车就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68598322b93eb8ddf98d062eec1153e651b63b1a74c0bffe28dfdbb175beda2b",
      "text": "好的，包在我身上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2038396a9893843f4fe447df07a1deff7dca19b45902571926616a82f3c3a1e5",
      "text": "想乐坐后排，\n雨彦请坐跟来时一样的副驾驶座吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:618f86f8f99ff91dd13cfbb3b5d31570648f924ebe37fcc5ec59e7baf2712514",
      "text": "坐克里斯先生开的车，好期待呀～。\n请多关照咯～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98f0814bbc43072f80099a480b79edd71a387b38a670e3136991a8d9fcfad424",
      "text": "好的，我会安全驾驶的。也算是一趟小小的\n兜风呢。我也很期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45f6710d13dd27d7333809f2f8f8a89113d22aa2d4ff0d2292daa2d76e448f34",
      "text": "北村加入进来之后，\n话题应该又会不一样了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b288883365f8aa96c8419e3dc3afcc5ae7d3f88adaf895e2f8cfc8a553111567",
      "text": "聊了些什么我大概能猜出来呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc76cc54f4f949d3cac3824ef81bbdfc7a90bad26fb557a8dbb254de7f449740",
      "text": "那就从那个话题开始聊起吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20cd8113b3c4193742ed1e13e9b44a47d7e05fc78202132c1276e7a3bcf35771",
      "text": "（庆祝别人，被别人庆祝，明明是别人的事却像\n自己的事一样开心……果然还是觉得有点不可思议）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_045sor_02_1_2_045_02:1_2_045_02_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:817c55e749d5357a537609fc4abe2edd68083449152d191a2c78e287e5a06de6",
      "text": "（不过。今年的生日，\n感觉会比去年更加令人难忘呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
